WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.649
Welcome to Orbit. Life so far. Our focus is Present Perfect or Past Simple.

2
00:00:07.649 --> 00:00:16.746
Use the present perfect for a period continuing until now. Use the past simple with a finished past time such as last year.

3
00:00:16.746 --> 00:00:19.730
Mina has lived here for four years.

4
00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:22.384
She won an award last year.

5
00:00:22.384 --> 00:00:25.893
She has already completed two projects.

6
00:00:25.893 --> 00:00:35.291
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
